<title>MALAYSIA: Nylex (Malaysia) 6-mth net up 12.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Nylex (Malaysia) 6-mth net up 12.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>    Net profit		 27.82	   vs	  24.67</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	18.6	    vs	  16.5</p>
<p>    Turnover		  262.77	   vs	 218.36</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   39.37	   vs	  35.60</p>
<p>    Minorities		  1.00	   vs	   0.61</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Nylex (Malaysia) Bhd. Company makes and markets vinyl-coated fabrics and plastic products and other items.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
